{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-17-1","title":"Luke 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ teaches to avoid occasions of offence; 3 and to forgive one another. 5 The power of faith. 6 How we are bound to God, and not he to us. 11 Christ heals ten lepers. 22 Of the kingdom of God, and the coming of the Son of Man.</p>\n<p>It is. Mt 16:23; 18:7; Ro 14:13,20,21; 16:17; 1Co 8:13; 10:32; 11:19 2Th 2:10-12; Re 2:14,20; 13:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-2","title":"Luke 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>better. Mt 18:6; 26:24; Mr 9:42; 1Co 9:15; 2Pe 2:1-3 one. Isa 40:11; Zec 13:7; Mt 18:3-5,10,14; Joh 21:15; 1Co 8:11,12; 9:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-3","title":"Luke 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>heed. 21:34; Ex 34:12; De 4:9,15,23; 2Ch 19:6,7; Eph 5:15; Heb 12:15 2Jo 1:8 If. Mt 18:15-17,21 rebuke. Le 19:17; Ps 141:5; Pr 9:8; 17:10; 27:5; Ga 2:11-14; Jas 5:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-4","title":"Luke 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>if. Mt 18:21,22,35; 1Co 13:4-7; Eph 4:31,32; Col 3:12,13 I repent. Mt 5:44; 6:12,14,15; 18:16; Ro 12:20; 2Th 3:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-5","title":"Luke 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Increase. Mr 9:24; 2Co 12:8-10; Php 4:13; 2Th 1:3; Heb 12:2; 1Pe 1:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-6","title":"Luke 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>If. Mt 17:20,21; 21:21; Mr 9:23; 11:22,23; 1Co 13:2 as. 13:19; Mt 13:31,32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-7","title":"Luke 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>13:15; 14:5; Mt 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-8","title":"Luke 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Make. Ge 43:16; 2Sa 12:20 and gird. 12:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-10","title":"Luke 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>1Ch 29:14-16; Job 22:2,3; 35:6,7; Ps 16:2,3; 35:6,7; Pr 16:2,3 Isa 6:5; 64:6; Mt 25:30,37-40; Ro 3:12; 11:35; 1Co 9:16,17; 15:9,10 Php 3:8,9; Phm 1:11; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-11","title":"Luke 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>9:51,52; Joh 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-12","title":"Luke 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>which. 5:12; 18:13; Le 13:45,46; Nu 5:2,3; 12:14; 2Ki 5:27; 7:3 2Ch 26:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-13","title":"Luke 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>have. 18:38,39; Mt 9:27; 15:22; 20:30,31; Mr 9:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-14","title":"Luke 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Go. 5:14; Le 13:1,2-46; 14:2-32; Mt 3:15; 8:4 as. 2Ki 5:14; Isa 65:24; Mt 8:3; Joh 2:5; 4:50-53; 9:7; 11:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-15","title":"Luke 17:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>17,18; 2Ch 32:24-26; Ps 30:1,2,11,12; 103:1-4; 107:20-22; 116:12-15 Ps 118:18,19; Isa 38:19-22; Joh 5:14; 9:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-16","title":"Luke 17:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>fell. 5:8; Ge 17:3; Mt 2:11; Mr 5:33; Joh 5:23; Ac 10:25,26; Re 4:10; 5:14 Re 19:4,5,10 and he. 9:52-56; 10:32-35; Joh 4:9,21,22,39-42; 8:48; Ac 1:8; 8:5-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-17","title":"Luke 17:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>but. Ge 3:9; Ps 106:13; Joh 8:7-10; Ro 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-18","title":"Luke 17:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>to give. Ps 29:1,2; 50:23; 106:13; Isa 42:12; Re 14:7 save. Mt 8:10,12; 15:24-28; 19:30; 20:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-19","title":"Luke 17:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>thy faith. 7:50; 8:48; 18:42; Mt 9:22; Mr 5:34; 10:52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-20","title":"Luke 17:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>when the. 10:11; 16:16; 19:11; Ac 1:6,7 observation. or, outward show. 23,24; Da 2:44; Zec 4:6; Joh 18:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-21","title":"Luke 17:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Lo here. 21:8; Mt 24:23-28; Mr 13:21 the kingdom. Ro 14:17; Col 1:27 within you. or, among you. 10:9-11; Mt 12:28; Joh 1:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-22","title":"Luke 17:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>when. 5:35; 13:35; Mt 9:15; Joh 7:33-36; 8:21-24; 12:35; 13:33; 16:5-7 Joh 16:16-22; 17:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-23","title":"Luke 17:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>21; 21:8; Mt 24:23-26; Mr 13:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-24","title":"Luke 17:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>as. Job 37:3,4; Zec 9:14; Mt 24:27 in. Mal 3:1,2; 4:1,2; Mt 24:30; 25:31; 26:64; 1Th 5:2; 2Th 2:2,8; Jas 5:8 2Pe 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-25","title":"Luke 17:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>must. 9:22; 18:31,33; 24:25,26,46; Mt 16:21; 17:22,23; 20:18,19; Mr 8:31 Mr 9:31; 10:33 rejected. 1Sa 8:7; 10:19; Isa 53:3; Mt 21:42; Mr 12:10; Joh 1:11; 12:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-26","title":"Luke 17:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>as. Ge 7:7-23 Noah. Job 22:15-18; Mt 24:37-39; Heb 11:7; 1Pe 3:19,20; 2Pe 2:5; 3:6 the days of the Son. 22,24; 18:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-27","title":"Luke 17:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>12:19,20; 16:19-23; De 6:10-12; 8:12-14; 1Sa 25:36-38; Job 21:9-13 Isa 21:4; 22:12-14; 1Th 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-28","title":"Luke 17:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Ge 13:13; 18:20,21; 19:4-15; Eze 16:49,50; Jas 5:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-29","title":"Luke 17:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Ge 19:16-25; De 29:23-25; Isa 1:9; 13:19; Jer 50:40; Ho 11:8 Am 4:11; Zep 2:9; Mt 11:23,24; 2Pe 2:6; Jude 1:7; Re 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-30","title":"Luke 17:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>24; 21:22,27,34-36; Mt 24:3,27-31; 26:64; Mr 13:26; 2Th 1:7 1Pe 1:13; Re 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-31","title":"Luke 17:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>he which.The flat-roofed eastern houses have stairs on the outside, by which a person may ascend and descend without coming into the house; and in walled cities they usually form continued terraces, from one end of the city to the other, terminating at the gates; so that one may pass along the tops of the houses and escape out of the city without coming down into the street.</p>\n<p>Job 2:4; Jer 45:5; Mt 6:25; 16:26; 24:17-21; Mr 13:14-16; Php 3:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-32","title":"Luke 17:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Ge 19:17,26; 1Co 10:6-12; Heb 10:38,39; 2Pe 2:18-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-33","title":"Luke 17:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>9:24,25; Mt 10:39; 16:25; Mr 8:35-37; Joh 12:25; Re 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-34","title":"Luke 17:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>I tell. 13:3,5,24; Isa 42:9; Mt 24:25; Mr 13:23; 14:29 in. Mt 24:40,41 two. Ps 26:9; 28:3; Jer 45:5; Eze 9:4-6; Mal 3:16-18; Ro 11:4-7 1Th 4:16,17; 2Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-35","title":"Luke 17:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>grinding. Ex 11:5; Jud 16:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-36","title":"Luke 17:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>\"This verse is wanting in most of the Greek copies.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-17-37","title":"Luke 17:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>wheresoever. Job 39:29,30; Da 9:26,27; Am 9:1-4; Zec 13:8,9; 14:2; Mt 24:28 1Th 2:16; Re 19:17,18</p>"}]}